<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34020" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβολ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>putting in</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				26
			</span></i> (pl.): esp. <i>putting into</i> its place,
			<i>setting</i> or <i>reduction</i> of a fracture or a dislocated
			limb, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβολὴν ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; <i>mode of setting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Art.</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>insertion</i> of a letter, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					437a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>lading</i> of a cargo, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PStrassb.</u>
				111.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				62.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>: esp. <i>shipment</i> of corn to Rome and
			Constantinople, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				15ii3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσία
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Edict.</u>
				13.4.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>inroad into an enemy's country, foray</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				[4.1.4]
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				4.3.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Θηβαίων ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1269b37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>charge</i>, of a bull, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				869
			</span></i>; of an army. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.1.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				12.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
				esp.<i>ramming of one ship by another</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				279
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				336
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπρῴροις χρῆσθαι ταῖς
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.36
			</span></i>, etc. (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσβολή</span>,
				<i>collision</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				70
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβολὰς ἔχειν</span> to
			receive <i>such charges</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.3.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοῦναι</span> to make
			<i>them</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.51.6
			</span></i>, etc.; in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				415
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβολαῖς χαλκοστόμοις</span> with
				<i>shocks</i> of brazen beaks (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβόλοις</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>shock</i> of battering-ram, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				42.5
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>stroke</i> or <i>discharge</i> of a missile, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.7.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				36
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>entrance, pass</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.4.48
			</span></i>; in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.191
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐμβολὴ τοῦ ποταμοῦ</span> is
			explained by the words <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ ἐς τὴν πόλιν
				ἐσβάλλει</span>; also, <i>mouth</i> of a river, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.11.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> pl.,
				<i>gusts</i> of wind, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνευμάτων
				σφοδρῶν ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				12.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>battering-ram</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ προέχον τῆς
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.76
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
